  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A lot of people have said that it is hard to use the focus feature on the camera. In VR it can also be very hard to see the focus clearly, which can cause some photos to be ruined as a result due to having some focus that wasn't able to see. I think it would be nice to have a toggle in the focus section that would replace the blur with a color to show where is being blurred easier. So, the more blur, the more solid the color would be and the less blur the more transparent the color. This would make it so that you can see if areas of the picture are blurred in VR when you otherwise wouldn't notice it because of the resolution limitations on some setups.",
